encoding  utf-8
survey GoughsOld

input NurseryEntrance/NurseryEntrance.th
input Concert/Concert.th
input Entrance/Entrance.th

equate 9@NurseryEntrance 10@Concert
equate 24@Entrance 10@Concert


join ConcertSE90_1@Concert NurseryEntranceSE90_1@NurseryEntrance -smooth on
join EntranceSE90_1@Entrance NurseryEntranceSE90_1@NurseryEntrance -smooth on
join roof1@Entrance:0 column1@NurseryEntrance:end -smooth off
join floor1@Entrance:end floor1@NurseryEntrance:5 -smooth off

map GoughsOldM -title "Gough's Old Cave"
  ConcertM@Concert
  EntranceM@Entrance
  NurseryEntranceM@NurseryEntrance
endmap

map GoughsOldME90
  ConcertME90@Concert
  EntranceME90@Entrance
  NurseryEntranceME90@NurseryEntrance
endmap




endsurvey

